<h3 id="divider-props" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#divider-props"><span>Divider Props</span></a></h3>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>属性</th>
<th>说明</th>
<th>类型</th>
<th>默认值</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>text-align</td>
<td>分割线文字位置</td>
<td><code v-pre>start</code>|<code v-pre>center</code>|<code v-pre>end</code></td>
<td><code v-pre>'center'</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>description</td>
<td>分割线文字描述</td>
<td><em>string</em></td>
<td><code v-pre>-</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>size-x</td>
<td>设置上下间距，支持'5px'、5、[5, 0]、xs、sm、md、lg、xg</td>
<td><em>number | string | number[]| string[]</em></td>
<td><code v-pre>-</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>size-y</td>
<td>设置左右间距，支持'5px'、5、[5, 0]、xs、sm、md、lg、xg</td>
<td><em>number | string | number[]| string[]</em></td>
<td><code v-pre>md</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>orientation</td>
<td>是否垂直，如果是'vertical'，则size-x控制上下间距，size-y控制左右间距。</td>
<td><code v-pre>horizontal</code> | <code v-pre>vertical</code></td>
<td><code v-pre>horizontal</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>type</td>
<td>分割线类型</td>
<td><code v-pre>dashed</code> | <code v-pre>dotted</code> | <code v-pre>solid</code> | <code v-pre>double</code></td>
<td><code v-pre>solid</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>thickness</td>
<td>分割线宽度/高度（thickness必须大于1）</td>
<td><em>number</em></td>
<td><code v-pre>1</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>hairline</td>
<td>0.5px 的分割线</td>
<td><em>boolean</em></td>
<td><code v-pre>false</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>color</td>
<td>分割线颜色</td>
<td><em>string</em></td>
<td><code v-pre>#363c54</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>opacity</td>
<td>分割线透明度</td>
<td><em>number</em></td>
<td><code v-pre>0.12</code></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
